<div class="faq-card-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
<p class="faq-question-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">How do I get 20% off my orders?</p>
<div class="faq-text-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4"><p>You’ll get a 15% discount automatically applied to your first two subscription orders. Every order after that will have a 20% discount.</p></div>
<div class="faq-buttons-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-card-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
<p class="faq-question-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">How can I use my discount code?</p>
<div class="faq-text-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4"><p>During checkout, look for the designated discount code field. Simply enter your code and click "apply" or a similar button.</p></div>
<div class="faq-buttons-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-card-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
<p class="faq-question-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">Can I use my gift card for a partial payment?</p>
<div class="faq-text-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4"><p>Yes, you can use your gift card for a partial payment and combine it with another payment method to cover the remaining balance.</p></div>
<div class="faq-buttons-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-column-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
<div class="faq-card-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
<p class="faq-question-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">How do I log into my account?</p>
<div class="faq-text-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4"><p>You can log into your account <a href="https://section.store/pages/404-2" title="404 #2">here</a>, with the email associated with your subscription.</p></div>
<div class="faq-buttons-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-card-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
<p class="faq-question-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">How do I cancel?</p>
<div class="faq-text-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4"><p>Select "Manage subscriptions" on the right. From there, you can click into the subscription you'd like to cancel and then scroll down and select "Cancel subscription."</p></div>
<div class="faq-buttons-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-card-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
<p class="faq-question-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">How can I check the balance of my gift card?</p>
<div class="faq-text-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4"><p>You can usually check your gift card balance online by visiting our website (link to gift card balance checker) or by calling customer service.</p></div>
<div class="faq-buttons-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-card-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
<p class="faq-question-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">Where can I find a store?</p>
<div class="faq-text-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4"><p>Use our handy online tool to search for stores by zip code, city, or even browse stores on a map. You can find the store locator on our website.</p></div>
<div class="faq-buttons-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-column-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
<div class="faq-card-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
<p class="faq-question-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">How do I update my address or credit card information?</p>
<div class="faq-text-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4"><p>To update your credit card information, click on "Manage payment methods." This will prompt an email to securely update your payment info.</p></div>
<div class="faq-buttons-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-card-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
<p class="faq-question-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">Can I add items to my subscription?</p>
<div class="faq-text-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4"><p>Yes. You can add different items to your subscription and still receive 20% off.</p></div>
<div class="faq-buttons-template--24585833414985__ss_faq_18_a9mLN4">
</div>
